,"y":603,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"할당량이","x":544,"y":603,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"20밀리초라면,","x":693,"y":601,"width":217,"height":40},{"text":"각","x":927,"y":602,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스는","x":974,"y":602,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"매","x":1161,"y":602,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"100밀리초마다","x":1210,"y":602,"width":240,"height":39},{"text":"최대로","x":1466,"y":602,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"20밀리","x":1590,"y":604,"width":101,"height":42}]},{"text":"초를 할당받을 것이다.","words":[{"text":"초를","x":325,"y":666,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"할당받을","x":408,"y":665,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":561,"y":666,"width":107,"height":37}]},{"text":"RR 알고리즘의 성능은 시간 할당량의 크기에 매우 많은 영향을 받는다. 극단적인","words":[{"text":"RR","x":389,"y":731,"width":54,"height":29},{"text":"알고리즘의","x":461,"y":728,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"성능은","x":649,"y":728,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":766,"y":727,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"할당량의","x":849,"y":727,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"크기에","x":1000,"y":728,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"매우","x":1121,"y":728,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"많은","x":1207,"y":729,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"영향을","x":1297,"y":729,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"받는다.","x":1420,"y":729,"width":116,"height":38},{"text":"극단적인","x":1557,"y":729,"width":134,"height":42}]},{"text":"경우, 시간 할당량이 매우 크면, RR 정책은 선입 선처리 정책과 같다. 이와 반대로 시간","words":[{"text":"경우,","x":325,"y":789,"width":77,"height":39},{"text":"시간","x":419,"y":790,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"할당량이","x":500,"y":790,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"매우","x":650,"y":791,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"크면,","x":730,"y":790,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"RR","x":820,"y":793,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"정책은","x":888,"y":790,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"선입","x":1002,"y":790,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"선처리","x":1084,"y":791,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"정책과","x":1203,"y":792,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"같다.","x":1322,"y":792,"width":78,"height":38},{"text":"이와","x":1420,"y":792,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"반대로","x":1506,"y":792,"width":109,"height":37},{"text":"시간","x":1630,"y":793,"width":63,"height":40}]},{"text":"할당량이 매우 적다면(예를 들면, 1마이크로초) RR 정책은 매우 많은 문맥 교환을 야기","words":[{"text":"할당량이","x":323,"y":852,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"매우","x":477,"y":853,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"적다면(예를","x":560,"y":853,"width":181,"height":40},{"text":"들면,","x":753,"y":852,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"1마이크로초)","x":844,"y":852,"width":199,"height":41},{"text":"RR","x":1059,"y":857,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"정책은","x":1128,"y":854,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"매우","x":1246,"y":854,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"많은","x":1332,"y":855,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"문맥","x":1417,"y":855,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"교환을","x":1505,"y":855,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"야기","x":1629,"y":856,"width":59,"height":40}]},{"text":"한다. 예를 들어 10시21} 단위를 갖는 하나의 프로세스를 갖고 있다고 가정하자. 시간 할","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":321,"y":914,"width":78,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":417,"y":915,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"들어","x":497,"y":915,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"10시21}","x":581,"y":915,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"단위를","x":700,"y":914,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"갖는","x":814,"y":914,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"하나의","x":895,"y":915,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스를","x":1010,"y":916,"width":174,"height":37},{"text":"갖고","x":1199,"y":917,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"있다고","x":1286,"y":918,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"가정하자.","x":1407,"y":918,"width":153,"height":38},{"text":"시간","x":1579,"y":918,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"할","x":1661,"y":921,"width":31,"height":37}]},{"text":"당량이 12시간 단위라면, 프로세스는 아무런 오버헤드 없이 하나의 시간 할당량 이전에","words":[{"text":"당량이","x":321,"y":976,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"12시간","x":440,"y":977,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"단위라면,","x":561,"y":977,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스는","x":720,"y":977,"width":168,"height"